        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Tremble, orcs! The vengeance of the elves is upon you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("So it is true! The elves have come to our aid!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hey! Do I look like an elf?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I can scarce believe I am fighting besides these betrayers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We cannot be choosy about our allies when our need is dire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Indeed not. Save your anger for our enemies, Landar."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I shall. But when our need is not so dire, there must be a reckoning..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("An elven army to the north? And they have dwarves with them? We must defeat them in detail before they combine, which means attacking before our reinforcements arrive. Maybe we can beat the humans before the elves can intervene. Overrun city and castle!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/goblins/rouser-2.webp",
            text: _("The brazen cry of a war-horn is heard in the distance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Aldun",
            type: "Horseman",
            side: 2,
            x: 32,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Aldun",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Aldun",
            x: 20,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("General Aldar has received your message. He asks that you engage the orcish reinforcements from the north, preventing them from joining with their fellows here. Those fresh troops must not be allowed to enter the battle! Our reinforcements should arrive in a few days."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Very well... But have you any word of the elvish troops marching to join us? We are too few to defeat the enemy without them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We have no news from the Ka’lian."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Kalenz! We come to fight beside you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Where is the rest of the elvish army? They were promised and should be here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The Great Council has decided it was too risky to send troops here. But some of us dissented and have come to fight beside you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That is well! If the Ka’lian is too fearful or blind to see what is needed, we must do it ourselves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It is not well that we have become so divided as this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("No, it is not. But if we do not defeat these orcs here and now our divisions will all be moot. I will take every sword-arm I can get and be glad of them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "l3_store_kalenz",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
                x: 9,
                y: 15,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:store_unit",
                variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
                kill: "yes",
                id: "$this_item.id",
              },
              {
                tag: "foreach",
                variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
                item: "this_item",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "this_item.facing",
                    value: "ne",
                    mode: "value",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:unstore_unit",
                    variable: "this_item",
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
